<gnc-act:title>
  Common Accounts
</gnc-act:title>
<gnc-act:short-description>
  A basic set of accounts most commonly used
</gnc-act:short-description>
<gnc-act:long-description>
  Most personal users, but not business users, will want to select this set of accounts. It includes most commonly used accounts (transaction, savings, cash, credit card, income, common expenses)
</gnc-act:long-description>
<gnc-act:start-selected>1</gnc-act:start-selected>

